{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":7,"title":"Self-knowledge and enlightenment","hosts":[{"id":"A","name":"Sonia","voice":"en-GB-SoniaNeural"},{"id":"B","name":"Brian","voice":"en-US-BrianMultilingualNeural"}],"duration":646.248,"segments":[{"title":"Welcome","start":0.0},{"title":"The story","start":33.552},{"title":"Lesson 1 · The thread","start":400.512},{"title":"Lesson 2 · Two natures","start":439.776},{"title":"Lesson 3 · Maya","start":471.096},{"title":"Lesson 4 · Four who seek","start":506.712},{"title":"Lesson 5 · According to faith","start":539.136},{"title":"Lesson 6 · Rare understanding","start":565.128},{"title":"Lesson 7 · Knowing everything","start":590.496},{"title":"Wrap-up","start":617.184}],"turns":[{"s":"A","start":0.0,"end":3.168,"text":"Welcome to Shruti. I'm Sonia.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.526,"Welcome"],[0.682,0.145,"to"],[0.839,0.618,"Shruti"],[1.882,0.211,"I'm"],[2.105,0.658,"Sonia"]]},{"s":"B","start":3.456,"end":9.576,"text":"And I'm Brian. Today, Chapter Seven: Self-knowledge and Enlightenment.","L":[],"words":[[0.066,0.118,"And"],[0.197,0.184,"I'm"],[0.395,0.513,"Brian"],[1.316,0.513,"Today"],[2.303,0.421,"Chapter"],[2.737,0.461,"Seven"],[3.908,0.895,"Self-knowledge"],[4.829,0.145,"and"],[4.987,0.75,"Enlightenment"]]},{"s":"A","start":9.864,"end":26.376,"text":"The first six chapters were mostly about us: our duty, our actions, our minds. With Chapter Seven, the Gita turns toward God. What is God made of? Where can you find God in the world? And who actually goes looking?","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.118,"The"],[0.274,0.368,"first"],[0.655,0.263,"six"],[0.932,0.553,"chapters"],[1.497,0.105,"were"],[1.616,0.447,"mostly"],[2.076,0.355,"about"],[2.445,0.329,"us"],[3.103,0.145,"our"],[3.261,0.539,"duty"],[4.024,0.184,"our"],[4.221,0.684,"actions"],[5.103,0.145,"our"],[5.261,0.632,"minds"],[6.289,0.237,"With"],[6.539,0.421,"Chapter"],[6.974,0.487,"Seven"],[7.711,0.105,"the"],[7.829,0.434,"Gita"],[8.276,0.408,"turns"],[8.697,0.368,"toward"],[9.079,0.461,"God"],[9.961,0.237,"What"],[10.211,0.145,"is"],[10.368,0.289,"God"],[10.671,0.276,"made"],[10.961,0.447,"of"],[11.829,0.211,"Where"],[12.053,0.197,"can"],[12.263,0.132,"you"],[12.408,0.408,"find"],[12.829,0.289,"God"],[13.132,0.105,"in"],[13.25,0.092,"the"],[13.355,0.605,"world"],[14.382,0.118,"And"],[14.513,0.25,"who"],[14.776,0.447,"actually"],[15.237,0.316,"goes"],[15.566,0.553,"looking"]]},{"s":"B","start":26.664,"end":32.688,"text":"Seven lessons today, and some of the most beautiful verses in the book. Story first.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.395,"Seven"],[0.5,0.474,"lessons"],[0.987,0.526,"today"],[1.539,0.211,"and"],[1.763,0.224,"some"],[2.0,0.053,"of"],[2.066,0.066,"the"],[2.145,0.316,"most"],[2.474,0.474,"beautiful"],[2.961,0.487,"verses"],[3.461,0.158,"in"],[3.632,0.105,"the"],[3.75,0.487,"book"],[4.617,0.421,"Story"],[5.051,0.566,"first"]]},{"s":"A","start":33.552,"end":49.224,"text":"Krishna opens with a promise. Seven point one and two: listen how you shall know Me fully without any doubt. I shall impart to you Self-knowledge, together with enlightenment, after knowing which nothing more remains to be known in this world.","L":["L7"],"words":[[0.101,0.632,"Krishna"],[0.745,0.553,"opens"],[1.311,0.158,"with"],[1.482,0.066,"a"],[1.561,0.684,"promise"],[2.658,0.395,"Seven"],[3.066,0.316,"point"],[3.395,0.211,"one"],[3.618,0.118,"and"],[3.75,0.395,"two"],[4.526,0.382,"listen"],[4.921,0.184,"how"],[5.118,0.145,"you"],[5.276,0.224,"shall"],[5.513,0.171,"know"],[5.697,0.145,"Me"],[5.855,0.408,"fully"],[6.276,0.434,"without"],[6.724,0.171,"any"],[6.908,0.539,"doubt"],[7.868,0.145,"I"],[8.026,0.224,"shall"],[8.263,0.5,"impart"],[8.776,0.092,"to"],[8.882,0.158,"you"],[9.053,0.855,"Self-knowledge"],[10.158,0.408,"together"],[10.579,0.171,"with"],[10.763,0.763,"enlightenment"],[11.842,0.289,"after"],[12.145,0.368,"knowing"],[12.526,0.211,"which"],[12.75,0.395,"nothing"],[13.158,0.132,"more"],[13.303,0.566,"remains"],[13.882,0.092,"to"],[13.987,0.118,"be"],[14.118,0.303,"known"],[14.434,0.092,"in"],[14.539,0.211,"this"],[14.763,0.526,"world"]]},{"s":"B","start":49.512,"end":62.352,"text":"And a sobering line right after, seven point three: scarcely one out of thousands of persons strives for perfection. And scarcely one among those successful strivers truly understands Me.","L":["L6"],"words":[[0.092,0.118,"And"],[0.224,0.053,"a"],[0.289,0.5,"sobering"],[0.803,0.368,"line"],[1.184,0.329,"right"],[1.526,0.461,"after"],[2.013,0.355,"seven"],[2.382,0.263,"point"],[2.658,0.447,"three"],[3.711,0.605,"scarcely"],[4.329,0.342,"one"],[4.697,0.158,"out"],[4.868,0.105,"of"],[4.987,0.474,"thousands"],[5.474,0.092,"of"],[5.579,0.395,"persons"],[5.987,0.487,"strives"],[6.487,0.158,"for"],[6.658,0.684,"perfection"],[7.776,0.158,"And"],[7.947,0.645,"scarcely"],[8.605,0.368,"one"],[9.0,0.421,"among"],[9.434,0.263,"those"],[9.711,0.645,"successful"],[10.368,0.632,"strivers"],[11.013,0.461,"truly"],[11.487,0.658,"understands"],[12.158,0.276,"Me"]]},{"s":"A","start":62.64,"end":74.28,"text":"That sounds discouraging at first. But I read it as honest. Krishna isn't saying don't bother. He's saying, this is worth more effort than most people give it.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.263,"That"],[0.418,0.474,"sounds"],[0.905,0.75,"discouraging"],[1.668,0.132,"at"],[1.813,0.671,"first"],[2.866,0.237,"But"],[3.116,0.105,"I"],[3.235,0.237,"read"],[3.485,0.197,"it"],[3.695,0.145,"as"],[3.853,0.618,"honest"],[4.853,0.592,"Krishna"],[5.459,0.329,"isn't"],[5.801,0.382,"saying"],[6.195,0.303,"don't"],[6.511,0.474,"bother"],[7.408,0.197,"He's"],[7.618,0.5,"saying"],[8.421,0.184,"this"],[8.618,0.132,"is"],[8.763,0.316,"worth"],[9.092,0.263,"more"],[9.368,0.461,"effort"],[9.842,0.145,"than"],[10.0,0.342,"most"],[10.355,0.316,"people"],[10.684,0.184,"give"],[10.882,0.368,"it"]]},{"s":"A","start":74.568,"end":87.24,"text":"Then a map of reality. Seven point four: the mind, intellect, ego, ether, air, fire, water and earth are the eightfold division of My material energy, Prakriti.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.142,0.263,"Then"],[0.418,0.053,"a"],[0.484,0.316,"map"],[0.813,0.145,"of"],[0.971,0.763,"reality"],[2.145,0.382,"Seven"],[2.539,0.276,"point"],[2.829,0.382,"four"],[3.526,0.079,"the"],[3.618,0.474,"mind"],[4.316,0.592,"intellect"],[5.145,0.434,"ego"],[5.816,0.461,"ether"],[6.5,0.289,"air"],[7.026,0.474,"fire"],[7.789,0.447,"water"],[8.329,0.197,"and"],[8.539,0.342,"earth"],[8.895,0.066,"are"],[8.974,0.171,"the"],[9.158,0.434,"eightfold"],[9.605,0.447,"division"],[10.066,0.092,"of"],[10.171,0.132,"My"],[10.316,0.579,"material"],[10.908,0.487,"energy"],[11.605,0.671,"Prakriti"]]},{"s":"B","start":87.528,"end":98.352,"text":"Seven point five: the material energy is My lower Nature. My other, higher Nature is Spirit, Purusha, by which this entire universe is sustained.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.092,0.342,"Seven"],[0.447,0.276,"point"],[0.737,0.579,"five"],[1.579,0.132,"the"],[1.724,0.539,"material"],[2.276,0.539,"energy"],[2.829,0.211,"is"],[3.053,0.197,"My"],[3.263,0.329,"lower"],[3.605,0.553,"Nature"],[4.592,0.237,"My"],[4.842,0.421,"other"],[5.276,0.395,"higher"],[5.684,0.461,"Nature"],[6.158,0.132,"is"],[6.303,0.539,"Spirit"],[6.868,0.737,"Purusha"],[7.908,0.237,"by"],[8.158,0.237,"which"],[8.408,0.211,"this"],[8.632,0.474,"entire"],[9.118,0.5,"universe"],[9.632,0.118,"is"],[9.763,0.671,"sustained"]]},{"s":"A","start":98.64,"end":110.352,"text":"Interesting that mind, intellect and ego are on the matter side of that list. In the Gita's view, even your thoughts are part of nature. The Spirit is what's aware of them.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.116,0.605,"Interesting"],[0.734,0.224,"that"],[0.971,0.447,"mind"],[1.668,0.618,"intellect"],[2.392,0.145,"and"],[2.55,0.461,"ego"],[3.024,0.158,"are"],[3.195,0.158,"on"],[3.366,0.079,"the"],[3.458,0.355,"matter"],[3.826,0.289,"side"],[4.129,0.092,"of"],[4.234,0.237,"that"],[4.484,0.487,"list"],[5.395,0.132,"In"],[5.539,0.105,"the"],[5.658,0.447,"Gita's"],[6.118,0.395,"view"],[6.829,0.263,"even"],[7.105,0.145,"your"],[7.263,0.5,"thoughts"],[7.776,0.066,"are"],[7.855,0.303,"part"],[8.171,0.118,"of"],[8.303,0.579,"nature"],[9.303,0.118,"The"],[9.434,0.566,"Spirit"],[10.013,0.184,"is"],[10.211,0.263,"what's"],[10.487,0.289,"aware"],[10.789,0.197,"of"],[11.0,0.316,"them"]]},{"s":"B","start":110.64,"end":121.152,"text":"Seven point six: all creatures have evolved from this twofold energy, and I am the source of origin, as well as dissolution, of the entire universe.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.092,0.382,"Seven"],[0.487,0.276,"point"],[0.776,0.539,"six"],[1.855,0.276,"all"],[2.145,0.461,"creatures"],[2.618,0.158,"have"],[2.789,0.487,"evolved"],[3.289,0.171,"from"],[3.474,0.158,"this"],[3.645,0.5,"twofold"],[4.158,0.539,"energy"],[5.224,0.197,"and"],[5.434,0.171,"I"],[5.618,0.132,"am"],[5.763,0.079,"the"],[5.855,0.395,"source"],[6.263,0.132,"of"],[6.408,0.618,"origin"],[7.276,0.211,"as"],[7.5,0.276,"well"],[7.789,0.118,"as"],[7.921,0.789,"dissolution"],[8.737,0.158,"of"],[8.908,0.066,"the"],[8.987,0.461,"entire"],[9.461,0.658,"universe"]]},{"s":"A","start":121.44,"end":133.272,"text":"And then one of the great images, seven point seven: there is nothing higher than Me, O Arjuna. Everything in the universe is strung on Me like jewels are strung on the thread of a necklace.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.116,0.145,"And"],[0.274,0.237,"then"],[0.524,0.171,"one"],[0.708,0.092,"of"],[0.813,0.105,"the"],[0.932,0.329,"great"],[1.274,0.553,"images"],[2.05,0.355,"seven"],[2.418,0.303,"point"],[2.734,0.434,"seven"],[3.511,0.105,"there"],[3.629,0.158,"is"],[3.8,0.382,"nothing"],[4.195,0.316,"higher"],[4.524,0.145,"than"],[4.682,0.276,"Me"],[5.221,0.171,"O"],[5.405,0.658,"Arjuna"],[6.461,0.513,"Everything"],[6.987,0.092,"in"],[7.092,0.079,"the"],[7.184,0.671,"universe"],[7.868,0.158,"is"],[8.039,0.342,"strung"],[8.395,0.145,"on"],[8.553,0.184,"Me"],[8.75,0.276,"like"],[9.039,0.513,"jewels"],[9.566,0.092,"are"],[9.671,0.382,"strung"],[10.066,0.105,"on"],[10.184,0.092,"the"],[10.289,0.289,"thread"],[10.592,0.092,"of"],[10.697,0.039,"a"],[10.75,0.697,"necklace"]]},{"s":"B","start":133.56,"end":140.184,"text":"You see the jewels. You don't see the thread. But take the thread away and the necklace falls apart.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.066,0.079,"You"],[0.158,0.263,"see"],[0.434,0.105,"the"],[0.553,0.618,"jewels"],[1.579,0.079,"You"],[1.671,0.237,"don't"],[1.921,0.211,"see"],[2.145,0.118,"the"],[2.276,0.526,"thread"],[3.211,0.132,"But"],[3.355,0.263,"take"],[3.632,0.105,"the"],[3.75,0.303,"thread"],[4.066,0.513,"away"],[4.592,0.158,"and"],[4.763,0.079,"the"],[4.855,0.474,"necklace"],[5.342,0.329,"falls"],[5.684,0.553,"apart"]]},{"s":"A","start":140.472,"end":162.36,"text":"Then Krishna shows where to look for him in ordinary things. Seven point eight and nine: I am the taste in water, the radiance in the sun and the moon, the sacred syllable Om in all the Vedas, the sound in the ether, and potency in human beings. I am the sweet fragrance in the earth, the heat in the fire, the life in all living beings.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.142,0.276,"Then"],[0.432,0.487,"Krishna"],[0.932,0.421,"shows"],[1.366,0.211,"where"],[1.589,0.145,"to"],[1.747,0.211,"look"],[1.971,0.132,"for"],[2.116,0.289,"him"],[2.418,0.197,"in"],[2.629,0.513,"ordinary"],[3.155,0.618,"things"],[4.184,0.382,"Seven"],[4.579,0.303,"point"],[4.895,0.211,"eight"],[5.118,0.105,"and"],[5.237,0.421,"nine"],[5.987,0.105,"I"],[6.105,0.158,"am"],[6.276,0.105,"the"],[6.395,0.355,"taste"],[6.763,0.105,"in"],[6.882,0.461,"water"],[7.553,0.105,"the"],[7.671,0.513,"radiance"],[8.197,0.079,"in"],[8.289,0.092,"the"],[8.395,0.276,"sun"],[8.684,0.092,"and"],[8.789,0.079,"the"],[8.882,0.382,"moon"],[9.579,0.092,"the"],[9.684,0.461,"sacred"],[10.158,0.487,"syllable"],[10.658,0.263,"Om"],[10.934,0.118,"in"],[11.066,0.145,"all"],[11.224,0.092,"the"],[11.329,0.566,"Vedas"],[12.184,0.105,"the"],[12.303,0.355,"sound"],[12.671,0.079,"in"],[12.763,0.079,"the"],[12.855,0.487,"ether"],[13.579,0.145,"and"],[13.737,0.658,"potency"],[14.408,0.145,"in"],[14.566,0.368,"human"],[14.947,0.618,"beings"],[15.987,0.132,"I"],[16.132,0.171,"am"],[16.316,0.105,"the"],[16.434,0.355,"sweet"],[16.803,0.553,"fragrance"],[17.368,0.092,"in"],[17.474,0.158,"the"],[17.645,0.408,"earth"],[18.316,0.079,"the"],[18.408,0.303,"heat"],[18.724,0.079,"in"],[18.816,0.092,"the"],[18.921,0.487,"fire"],[19.684,0.105,"the"],[19.803,0.395,"life"],[20.211,0.145,"in"],[20.368,0.171,"all"],[20.553,0.316,"living"],[20.882,0.618,"beings"]]},{"s":"B","start":162.648,"end":171.12,"text":"The taste in water. That's my favorite. Next time you're really thirsty and that first sip lands, that's where Krishna says to look.","L":[],"words":[[0.079,0.066,"The"],[0.158,0.421,"taste"],[0.592,0.158,"in"],[0.763,0.539,"water"],[1.697,0.237,"That's"],[1.947,0.184,"my"],[2.145,0.658,"favorite"],[3.184,0.276,"Next"],[3.474,0.276,"time"],[3.763,0.171,"you're"],[3.947,0.263,"really"],[4.224,0.618,"thirsty"],[4.855,0.118,"and"],[4.987,0.197,"that"],[5.197,0.289,"first"],[5.5,0.211,"sip"],[5.724,0.487,"lands"],[6.395,0.263,"that's"],[6.671,0.158,"where"],[6.842,0.395,"Krishna"],[7.25,0.276,"says"],[7.539,0.105,"to"],[7.658,0.421,"look"]]},{"s":"B","start":171.408,"end":185.904,"text":"Seven point ten and eleven: know Me to be the eternal seed of all creatures. I am the intelligence of the intelligent, the brilliance of the brilliant, the strength of the strong that is devoid of lust and attachment.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.092,0.395,"Seven"],[0.5,0.316,"point"],[0.829,0.408,"ten"],[1.25,0.145,"and"],[1.408,0.566,"eleven"],[2.632,0.237,"know"],[2.882,0.158,"Me"],[3.053,0.145,"to"],[3.211,0.25,"be"],[3.474,0.079,"the"],[3.566,0.447,"eternal"],[4.026,0.408,"seed"],[4.447,0.105,"of"],[4.566,0.224,"all"],[4.803,0.658,"creatures"],[5.882,0.171,"I"],[6.066,0.171,"am"],[6.25,0.066,"the"],[6.329,0.711,"intelligence"],[7.053,0.132,"of"],[7.197,0.066,"the"],[7.276,0.803,"intelligent"],[8.461,0.171,"the"],[8.645,0.539,"brilliance"],[9.197,0.132,"of"],[9.342,0.105,"the"],[9.461,0.605,"brilliant"],[10.513,0.132,"the"],[10.658,0.513,"strength"],[11.184,0.092,"of"],[11.289,0.079,"the"],[11.382,0.513,"strong"],[11.908,0.132,"that"],[12.053,0.132,"is"],[12.197,0.487,"devoid"],[12.697,0.158,"of"],[12.868,0.395,"lust"],[13.276,0.092,"and"],[13.382,0.724,"attachment"]]},{"s":"A","start":186.192,"end":195.024,"text":"And notice the qualifier: strength that is devoid of lust and attachment. Not every kind of strength. The clean kind.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.171,"And"],[0.326,0.434,"notice"],[0.774,0.092,"the"],[0.879,0.75,"qualifier"],[1.958,0.5,"strength"],[2.471,0.184,"that"],[2.668,0.105,"is"],[2.787,0.447,"devoid"],[3.247,0.105,"of"],[3.366,0.447,"lust"],[3.826,0.105,"and"],[3.945,0.829,"attachment"],[5.184,0.316,"Not"],[5.513,0.276,"every"],[5.803,0.329,"kind"],[6.145,0.092,"of"],[6.25,0.671,"strength"],[7.342,0.105,"The"],[7.461,0.368,"clean"],[7.842,0.605,"kind"]]},{"s":"A","start":195.312,"end":211.344,"text":"Then the three modes of nature, the gunas: goodness, passion, and ignorance. They come from Krishna, but he isn't caught by them. And seven point thirteen: people are deluded by these three, so they don't know Me, who is above them.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.129,0.263,"Then"],[0.405,0.092,"the"],[0.511,0.289,"three"],[0.813,0.303,"modes"],[1.129,0.118,"of"],[1.261,0.513,"nature"],[2.011,0.092,"the"],[2.116,0.684,"gunas"],[3.129,0.605,"goodness"],[3.997,0.553,"passion"],[4.734,0.145,"and"],[4.892,0.75,"ignorance"],[6.066,0.132,"They"],[6.211,0.303,"come"],[6.526,0.197,"from"],[6.737,0.579,"Krishna"],[7.605,0.158,"but"],[7.776,0.145,"he"],[7.934,0.276,"isn't"],[8.224,0.329,"caught"],[8.566,0.197,"by"],[8.776,0.316,"them"],[9.513,0.158,"And"],[9.684,0.368,"seven"],[10.066,0.303,"point"],[10.382,0.684,"thirteen"],[11.395,0.355,"people"],[11.763,0.066,"are"],[11.842,0.539,"deluded"],[12.395,0.171,"by"],[12.579,0.276,"these"],[12.868,0.382,"three"],[13.513,0.132,"so"],[13.658,0.132,"they"],[13.803,0.276,"don't"],[14.0