 first time because something has gone wrong. The Gita doesn't sneer at that. It says, you came. That's noble.","L":[],"words":[[0.066,0.224,"That's"],[0.303,0.329,"very"],[0.645,0.724,"generous"],[1.789,0.395,"Most"],[2.197,0.118,"of"],[2.329,0.197,"us"],[2.539,0.237,"come"],[2.789,0.105,"to"],[2.908,0.355,"God"],[3.276,0.079,"the"],[3.368,0.329,"first"],[3.711,0.395,"time"],[4.118,0.329,"because"],[4.461,0.355,"something"],[4.829,0.158,"has"],[5.0,0.263,"gone"],[5.276,0.461,"wrong"],[6.145,0.079,"The"],[6.237,0.342,"Gita"],[6.592,0.342,"doesn't"],[6.947,0.461,"sneer"],[7.421,0.132,"at"],[7.566,0.408,"that"],[8.354,0.079,"It"],[8.446,0.303,"says"],[8.775,0.158,"you"],[8.946,0.474,"came"],[9.829,0.276,"That's"],[10.118,0.566,"noble"]]},{"s":"B","start":275.448,"end":286.56,"text":"Seven point nineteen: after many births the enlightened one comes to Me, realizing that everything is My manifestation. Such a great soul is very rare.","L":["L6"],"words":[[0.092,0.421,"Seven"],[0.526,0.289,"point"],[0.829,0.737,"nineteen"],[2.145,0.329,"after"],[2.487,0.289,"many"],[2.789,0.461,"births"],[3.263,0.079,"the"],[3.355,0.539,"enlightened"],[3.908,0.276,"one"],[4.197,0.303,"comes"],[4.513,0.118,"to"],[4.645,0.316,"Me"],[5.526,0.697,"realizing"],[6.237,0.211,"that"],[6.461,0.5,"everything"],[6.974,0.158,"is"],[7.145,0.171,"My"],[7.329,0.947,"manifestation"],[8.657,0.263,"Such"],[8.933,0.066,"a"],[9.012,0.303,"great"],[9.328,0.408,"soul"],[9.749,0.171,"is"],[9.933,0.316,"very"],[10.262,0.461,"rare"]]},{"s":"A","start":286.848,"end":307.128,"text":"Then a remarkably open verse, seven point twenty-one and twenty-two: whosoever desires to worship whatever deity, using any name, form and method, with faith, I make their faith steady in that very deity. They worship it and their wishes are fulfilled, but those wishes are, indeed, granted only by Me.","L":["L5"],"words":[[0.129,0.237,"Then"],[0.379,0.053,"a"],[0.445,0.711,"remarkably"],[1.168,0.368,"open"],[1.55,0.421,"verse"],[2.195,